    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hentai Kai</strong> is a mysterious and seductive puzzle game that immerses you in a world of piracy, danger, and forbidden pleasures. The game is crafted in an atmospheric black-and-white style, transporting you to an era when sea rogues ruled the waves, and legends were whispered by candlelight.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629750/extras/124c5b65a89e8fc0098c4e5c58a16dd8.poster.avif?t=1755419809\" width=640 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629750/extras/124c5b65a89e8fc0098c4e5c58a16dd8.webm?t=1755419809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629750/extras/124c5b65a89e8fc0098c4e5c58a16dd8.mp4?t=1755419809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main heroine is <strong>Kai</strong>, a bold and alluring pirate. She braves storms, hunts for treasures, and plays deadly games with fate. As you solve puzzles, you will gradually unlock scenes from her life\u2014each one becoming more revealing and captivating.<br><br>\u2728Game Features:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>30 levels</strong> \u2013 uncover the secrets of Kai\u2019s journey!<br>\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>30 achievements</strong> \u2013 prove your mastery and unlock all rewards!<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Gallery</strong> \u2013 revisit every unlocked moment in stunning detail!<br>\u2b50\ufe0fThree Difficulty Levels:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u2601\ufe0f <strong>Easy</strong> \u2013 perfect for beginners and those who want to enjoy the game at a relaxed pace.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u2694\ufe0f <strong>Moderate</strong> \u2013 a balanced challenge for puzzle lovers seeking the perfect mix of difficulty and enjoyment.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udc80 <strong>Hard</strong> \u2013 a true test for puzzle masters where every piece matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more vividly the seductive side of this dangerous adventure unfolds. Can you piece together every fragment of her story and dive into a sensual world of shadows and passion?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hentai Kai</strong> is a mysterious and seductive puzzle game that immerses you in a world of piracy, danger, and forbidden pleasures. The game is crafted in an atmospheric black-and-white style, transporting you to an era when sea rogues ruled the waves, and legends were whispered by candlelight.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629750/extras/124c5b65a89e8fc0098c4e5c58a16dd8.poster.avif?t=1755419809\" width=640 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629750/extras/124c5b65a89e8fc0098c4e5c58a16dd8.webm?t=1755419809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629750/extras/124c5b65a89e8fc0098c4e5c58a16dd8.mp4?t=1755419809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main heroine is <strong>Kai</strong>, a bold and alluring pirate. She braves storms, hunts for treasures, and plays deadly games with fate. As you solve puzzles, you will gradually unlock scenes from her life\u2014each one becoming more revealing and captivating.<br><br>\u2728Game Features:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>30 levels</strong> \u2013 uncover the secrets of Kai\u2019s journey!<br>\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>30 achievements</strong> \u2013 prove your mastery and unlock all rewards!<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Gallery</strong> \u2013 revisit every unlocked moment in stunning detail!<br>\u2b50\ufe0fThree Difficulty Levels:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u2601\ufe0f <strong>Easy</strong> \u2013 perfect for beginners and those who want to enjoy the game at a relaxed pace.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u2694\ufe0f <strong>Moderate</strong> \u2013 a balanced challenge for puzzle lovers seeking the perfect mix of difficulty and enjoyment.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \ud83d\udc80 <strong>Hard</strong> \u2013 a true test for puzzle masters where every piece matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more vividly the seductive side of this dangerous adventure unfolds. Can you piece together every fragment of her story and dive into a sensual world of shadows and passion?</p>",
